# What `dart pub publish` leaves out of the archive.
#
# Conformance is verified from a repository checkout, never from the published
# package (RELEASING.md), so the suite that reads ../../spec/ has no business in
# a pub.dev archive — its vectors are not there and it could not run.
#
# A .pubignore replaces .gitignore for this directory, so the locally generated
# files a .gitignore would have caught are named here too.
test/
.dart_tool/
pubspec.lock
